", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:27:30Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Qatar and France", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:27:43Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "They asked if both can get gold", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:27:47Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "So they decided to share", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:28:04Z", "username": "Anurag Bhide", "text": "I remember them celebrating. Very wholesome 😊", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:28:16Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Absolutely.  What a lovely moment that was", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:29:01Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "And it was the Qatar athlete who asked. He was favourite to win. The French guy was just coming back from injury.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:29:21Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "And both are friends who train together", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:29:33Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "So was truly wholesome", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-02T06:30:01Z", "username": "Nikunj", "text": "This happened in the 1936 pole vault where there was a tie between the japanese athletes Nisida & Oe and they refused to enter into a ti break because of mutual respect. The IOC awarded silver to Oe & bronze to nishda but they later went to jewler and came up with this", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_corr